              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Special character. Armed with a hand weapon, bow and light armour. May ride in a two-horse light chariot bought at additional cost. Army General. Casting the Oracle Bones. Fearsome. Warrior of Legend. Not available to the Army of Sanxingdui. The grave of Fuhao was discovered in 1976 at the Royal tombs in Anyang. 0-1. (The Art of War p.14)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="60f3-bb9c-3f48-76cd" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">6+</characteristic>
