              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">One crewman armed with a hand weapon, bow and light armour riding in a two-horse light chariot with unarmed driver. Light Chariots. Not available to the Pre-Shang and Early Shang or the Army of Sanxingdui compositions (the Sanxingdui use Elephants instead). (The Art of War p.13)</characteristic>
