              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon, shield and axe. May have light armour (+2), bow (+2), or thrusting spear instead of axe. Royal Guard. May only be fielded if the King is Army Commander. 0-1. (The Art of War p.13)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
